uild/typecheck, live backend and Electron packaging were not run.\n\nUser-verified patch release. No data migration required.\n","isDraft":false,"isPrerelease":false,"publishedAt":"2026-09-26T05:32:14Z","tagName":"v1.4.84","url":"https://github.com/AutoByteus/autobyteus-workspace/releases/tag/v1.4.84"}
